<title>HONG KONG: Guangzhou ITIC sets US$40 mln 364-day FRCD.</title>
<headline>Guangzhou ITIC sets US$40 mln 364-day FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was</p>
<p>announced by arranger Banque Francaise du Commerce Exterieur</p>
<p>(&quot;BFCE&quot;).</p>
<p>BORROWER  GUANGZHOU INTERNATIONAL TRUST &amp; INVESTMENT CORP</p>
<p> AMOUNT     US$40 MLN  COUPON     6ML+30     MATURITY  364 DAYS</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRCD	 ISS PRICE  PAR	  LAUNCHED  20.MAR.97</p>
<p> PUTS	 NONE	 CALLS	NONE	 REPLIES   09.APR.97</p>
<p> LISTING    NONE	 REPAYMENT  BULLET     DENOMS    $500K</p>
<p> RATING     NONE	 SALE LMTS  STANDARD   TAX PROV  --</p>
<p> NEG PLG    --	   CRS DEF    --	   FORCE MAJ --</p>
<p> HOME CTRY  CHINA	GOV LAW    SINGAPORE  PAY DATE  NOT YET</p>
<p>									 FIXED</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>   CO-LEAD MANAGERS    US$4-5 MLN   85BP   ALL-IN  115</p>
<p>   SENIOR MANAGERS     US$2-3 MLN   80BP   ALL-IN  110</p>
<p>ARRANGERS  BANKGESELLSCHAFT BERLIN (EUROPEAN AND MIDDLE EASTERN</p>
<p>		BOOKS), BFCE (BOOKS AND AGENT), HANA BANK (KOREAN</p>
<p>		BOOKS) AND KOOKMIN BANK.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
